     pandoc's default reference with them (tools/fb/src/docxref.rs). Mirrors typst/caed-motion-brief.typ: Times New
     Roman 12 pt (the typst face); double spacing as exact 24 pt lines (L.R. 130(c)); single spacing as exact 13.8 pt
     for counsel, caption, tables and signature; letter size, top margin 1 in, 28 lines of 24 pt between the top
     margin and the footer, left margin 1.5 in, right 1 in (the typst margins); numbered lines 1 to 28 in the left
     margin, ending at 1 in from the page edge as in typst (header frame rId101, L.R. 130(b)); a double rule at the
     text's left edge and a single rule at its right (page borders); the footer (description and page number on
     one line, L.R. 130(d)). The final section numbers its pages in arabic from 1 (the memorandum); docx/render.sh
     adds the section breaks' footers and headers. Nothing case-specific is written here. -->
